{"4721680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Braincell: Escape", "steam_appid": 4721680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Braincell: Escape </strong>is a humorous, asymmetrical multiplayer game in which one player takes on the role of the fugitive, while the others cooperate as the police. The fugitive tries to gather resources, conceal their identity, and reach the escape point, while the officers collect clues, search the area, and coordinate the pursuit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main characters:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fugitive (Orange Braincell)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clever, chaotic, and definitely way too confident. His goal is to disappear off the map, secure a fake identity, and reach the escape point before the police cut off every possible route. He can improvise, hide in absurd places, and pull off ideas that sound terrible on paper but somehow work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Police Officer (Blue Braincell)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alert, stubborn, and fully prepared to search half the map over a single suspicious report. He operates based on clues, tips from civilians, and coordination with other officers. He must quickly assess situations, secure areas, and anticipate the fugitive’s moves before he vanishes across the border. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goals in the game :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4721680/extras/c5e07a6924c077f4304848531a8c4237.avif?t=1778694315\" width=1280 height=497 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Prototype build. Release date: TBD. Wishlist now!</